# The CAD kernel is NOT a runtime dependency of the 'partcad' wheel - the core
# builds/renders/exports every shape in sandboxed runtimes and carries geometry
# as BREP-byte envelopes. It is a *test* dependency: several unit tests import
# OCP/build123d/cadquery directly to verify geometry (test_geom, test_part_compound,
# test_assembly, test_assembly_serialize, ...), and pytest collection fails without
# them. Pinned to the versions the sandboxes use (see sandbox_versions.py).
